"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"66"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ae/aea0e729045e4be296eb2d97156cda81a8484103f201c98580c1434dc8a966f8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3a0c518c4ffad972082ee5514823071ae4f1311675eccd2bf120f094f7f4f054.webp","width":229,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c93196","characterName":"カタリナ・クラエス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c93196"},"originalCharacterName":"カタリナ・クラエス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"624"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The main protagonist, a 17-year-old otaku who has been reincarnated as the villain character of the game Fortune Lover. Having extensive knowledge of Fortune Lover, including the fact that all the routes in the game lead to either her death or exile, she takes drastic measures to avoid such outcomes, such as trying to establish good relationships with her peers and take up gardening as a profession should her exile come to pass. Her kind nature leads to many of the other characters falling in love with her, but she is generally oblivious to their affections. Despite attempting to learn magic, the only magic she can perform is creating bumps in the ground."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c93196"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e6/e6a25998a0f82d1e9c9571d07f8e25112116f6f4bb2d1b51bd1c8a1ee6548c6c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e5/e5f3c702dfc2700d9e0ed4307956a6c29cd8bb04db70179a36a542ec66c9d058.webp","width":229,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"内田 真礼","creatorId":"vndb:s1326","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1326","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1326","name":"内田 真礼","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:85776","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c93197","characterName":"ジオルド・スティアート","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c93197"},"originalCharacterName":"ジオルド・スティアート","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"820"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A prince who became Catarina's fiancé after he inadvertently caused her to trip and injure herself, forcing him to take responsibility. In the game, Catarina uses this to her advantage to monopolize him for herself. In the good ending he exiles Catarina and marries the protagonist, whilst the bad ending has him kill Catarina and abandoning the heroine due to guilt. Due to Catarina's continued efforts to better herself and avoid the bad endings, he now has developed genuine feelings for her and continuously tries to demonstrate his affection by confirming their engagement, however, it is overlooked by Catarina's dense persona much to his chagrin."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c93197"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e5/e55834c4f2600f037534d80b20ac4043112486c34f13483ab17a21523af0a5fa.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/28/28c52cc4fe7535edf541726e677a5b1ea385d12acc762fb92c668ddb72c401a2.webp","width":229,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"蒼井 翔太","creatorId":"vndb:s141","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s141","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s141","name":"蒼井 翔太","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:85772","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"瀬戸 麻沙美","creatorId":"vndb:s1433","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1433","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1433","name":"瀬戸 麻沙美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:85777","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c93198","characterName":"キース・クラエス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c93198"},"originalCharacterName":"キース・クラエス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1228"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Catarina's adoptive brother and an earth magic prodigy. In the game, Catarina bullied him, causing him to grow up to become a womanizer. In the good ending, he has Catarina exiled and abandons his womanizing ways to be with the protagonist, whilst the bad has him kill his sister in a fit of rage before disappearing. To avoid these endings, Catarina goes out of her way to be a good sister to him, which does improve their relationships but also saddles Keith with the thankless task of having to keep Catarina out of trouble, mostly to no avail. He also seems to be a foil to Geordo's attempts at getting closer to Catarina as he himself has feelings for her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c93198"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7d/7df3227fec2bec5a47345091942bf81e28d8e8cb47a2057ed27e8892e7a83e90.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/54/5437593fb71a6dcd65cf47f80178aa8e2fd1c484d798f0fa2f5ef70b0c448354.webp","width":229,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"柿原 徹也","creatorId":"vndb:s80","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s80","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s80","name":"柿原 徹也","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:85769","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"雨宮 天","creatorId":"vndb:s7409","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7409","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7409","name":"雨宮 天","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:85780","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c93199","characterName":"アラン・スティアート","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c93199"},"originalCharacterName":"アラン・スティアート","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"820"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Geordo's twin brother and Mary's fiancé. He was jealous of his more talented brother which made him into an introvert. In the game, Catarina actually doesn't appear in his path, as Mary serves as the rival character instead. After Catarina becomes friends with Mary, he became angered by how she is constantly ignoring him in favor of her. This causes him to challenge Catarina to a series of competitions, which she handily wins. Over time, however, he and Catarina become friends and his relationship with his brother also becomes better. He is also a skilled pianist, and his recitals are not only sought after but he has a large fan club with many of the ladies of his peerage. He has a crush on Catarina, however he has yet to realize these feelings due to Mary's interference."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c93199"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0f/0f69ce36d1b146935b2f87dd96425450cad30592d33740b88aa349c27e24113f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fb/fbc99f6c99d209f7f26cb65a3fa0bb4b2b9743ed6f8a3b06c0e38018d95dfbfc.webp","width":229,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"鈴木 達央","creatorId":"vndb:s376","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s376","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s376","name":"鈴木 達央","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:85774","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"田村 睦心","creatorId":"vndb:s11724","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11724","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11724","name":"田村睦心","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:85782","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c93200","characterName":"ニコル・アスカルト","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c93200"},"originalCharacterName":"ニコル・アスカルト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"17"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"507"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Geordo and Alan's childhood friend and Sophia's brother. He is considered handsome by all who see him, with a smile that can charm both males and females. Details regarding his story in the game are sparse, since Catarina never played his route. Not only this, but the main rival in his route is Sophia Ascart, his younger sister as he is quite overprotective of her. Despite this though, he seems to have developed a crush on Catarina after she got him to open up to her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c93200"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/dd0ddfcc3db7e8415b611067a9d0032c0d7bb033195ca16286e74f2034b81d5e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/68/68607cbf66d68149adaef895f51e9e7c671c2d658e318b6c5d2fdd415c48533e.webp","width":229,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"松岡 禎丞","creatorId":"vndb:s748","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s748","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s748","name":"松岡 禎丞","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:85775","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"M・A・O","creatorId":"vndb:s7526","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7526","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7526","name":"市道 真央","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:85781","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c93201","characterName":"メアリ・ハント","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c93201"},"originalCharacterName":"メアリ・ハント","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1104"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Alan's fiancée and the rival character during his path in the game. Despite this though, she generally has better fates than Catarina, with her staying together with Alan in the bad ending and peacefully rescinding her fiancée status in the good one. While she and Catarina had no relationship in the game, she became good friends with the current Catarina after the latter praised her garden. However, in the game, she fell in love with Alan after he praised her garden; therefore, since Catarina praised it first, it now seems like she has developed romantic feelings for her instead. She constantly places doubt in Alan's feelings for Catarina as she does not want him to realize them due to the fact that she wants Catarina for herself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c93201"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d083a61d8f0bbd4ea1d0169788b56a7e4adca8d919a7c92363a8d373100f13b5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3e/3e13a4707a005b43ecc9f2825f300229a7262d1b89f803247129670d548bfcb9.webp","width":229,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡咲 美保","creatorId":"vndb:s21931","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21931","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21931","name":"岡咲 美保","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:85783","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c93202","characterName":"マリア・キャンベル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c93202"},"originalCharacterName":"マリア・キャンベル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"910"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who, in Fortune Lover, was the main protagonist 